---
---

<section id="bootcamp" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-200/80 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-blue-50/30">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="elegant-card rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border-2 border-blue-200/90 bg-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Decorative background accent -->
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-blue-100/50 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-amber-100/40 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
        <!-- Left Column: Copy & Value Proposition -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 font-mono text-xs text-blue-700">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600 live-indicator"></span>
            <span class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Live small-group training</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 font-sans leading-tight">
            Set up your AI Business OS with Samuel Michelot
          </h2>

          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            In the AI Bootcamp at Simple AI Studio, you set up an AI Business OS for your own business. Samuel guides you through the work step by step, in a small group of founders and business operators.
          </p>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1">
                1. Your second brain
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Organize your company knowledge in open Markdown files you own and can keep using outside any one cloud database.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1">
                2. Practical skills
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Turn recurring workflows into portable skills. Test them with your AI harness and define when approval is needed.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1">
                3. Your own AI plan
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Use your existing AI plan through its official harness, within its usage limits, or choose your own API key.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1">
                4. An existing AI app
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Start from the graphical app of a supported harness. A dedicated skill cockpit is an optional extension.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CTAs -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-4">
            <a
              href="https://simpleaistudio.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2 group">
              <span>See the AI Bootcamp</span>
              <span class="group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://contact.samuelmichelot.com/?lang=en&source_site=yaibos"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 font-mono text-xs font-semibold transition-all">
              Ask Samuel a question
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 pt-1">
            Delivered live online by Simple AI Studio. Small groups for founders, managers, and small-business operators.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Visual Cohort Blueprint Card -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-6 space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-200">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">What you will work on</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-semibold">
                SIMPLE AI STUDIO
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 font-sans">
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200">
                <div class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span>Week 1: Set up your tools</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Foundations</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">
                  Install your local desktop harness, configure Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers, and connect your AI subscriptions.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200">
                <div class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span>Week 2: Your second brain</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Memory</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">
                  Build your company context in open Markdown and define clear operating rules for your AI.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200">
                <div class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span>Week 3: Standard operating procedures</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Skills</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">
                  Capture your processes as portable skills with clear inputs, outputs and approval rules.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200">
                <div class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span>Week 4: Put skills to work</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Operations</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">
                  Run and improve your skills in the chosen harness. Estimate time saved and identify useful next steps.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
              <span>See upcoming training dates</span>
              <a href="https://simpleaistudio.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">
                simpleaistudio.com ↗
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
